- d.dims: dimension registry (posward from home)
- d.vars: master setting names (posward from home) and group member clones
- d.values: active setting values (posward from setting name)
- d.groups: top-level group rank (posward from home; 1st cell is blank empty group) and sibling groups
- d.subgroups: hierarchical subgroup rank (posward from parent group)
- d.clone: master setting to group clone, and prototype type cell to schema type clone
- d.notes: store description (posward from home) and setting description (posward from setting)
- d.schemas: schema shape blank cell (posward from setting), and expected type clones
- d.alternates: alternative schema shape choices (posward between blank cells)
- d.default: default value cell (posward from each schema type clone) [home] [value kind: none] (Focused)"
